    "metadata": {
      "author": "Yu & Ai",
      "authorTitle": "",
      "description": "A door in two leaves. The gap between them opens into a full round moon and closes again: the moon is not drawn, it is the gap, and whatever is behind the door shows through. 閒 (門 + 月, 隙也): moonlight seen through the gap of a door, the first way 間 was written. artbitrage.io, a place to meet art.",
      "keywords": [
        "artbitrage",
        "閒",
        "間",
        "the gap",
        "Yu & Ai"
      ],
